    } elseif ($active==='credits') {
        ?><section class="shell section page-section"><?php title_block('THE PEOPLE / THE HISTORY','Built on their shoulders.','This project is a community fork of a fork. Its roots belong to the creators of Z and the developers who made Zod Engine possible.');?><div class="guide-layout"><aside><a href="#lineage">01 / Project lineage</a><a href="#original">02 / Original Z</a><a href="#contributors">03 / Contributors</a><a href="#licenses">04 / Licenses &amp; sources</a></aside><div class="guide-content"><article id="lineage"><span class="eyebrow">01 / PROJECT LINEAGE</span><h2>Three projects. A shared history.</h2><ol><li><strong>zod-enhanced — this project.</strong> Builds on fenio’s SDL3 fork with further game improvements, dedicated servers, and this independent website and account service.</li><li><strong><a href="https://github.com/fenio/zod">fenio/zod — the upstream SDL3 fork.</a></strong> Credit to fenio and its contributors for modernizing Zod Engine for current machines, including the SDL3 port, rendering, input, builds, and platform support.</li><li><strong><a href="https://zod.sourceforge.net/">Zod Engine — Michael Bok / Nighsoft.</a></strong> The original open-source engine remake of Z, released under GPLv3. This fork inherits its engine, gameplay foundations, and the work of its original contributors.</li></ol><p>Zod Engine is a remake of the commercial game Z; it is a separate project from that original game.</p></article><article id="original"><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE ORIGINAL GAME · 1996</span><h2>Z, by The Bitmap Brothers.</h2><p>Full credit for the original Z goes to <strong>The Bitmap Brothers</strong> and the original development team: its programmers, designers, artists, animators, writers, audio and music creators, testers, and production staff. Their game, characters, robot armies, visual style, and humour are the foundation of this project.</p><p>The original release was published by <strong>Renegade Software</strong> and <strong>Virgin Interactive</strong>. Thanks also to the people behind its subsequent ports and releases.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.mobygames.com/game/346/z/credits/dos/">Original DOS release: individual developer credits</a></p><p>This is an unofficial community project. It is not an official release by, or an assertion of endorsement from, The Bitmap Brothers, the original publishers, or their successors.</p></article><article id="contributors"><span class="eyebrow">03 / ART &amp; COMMUNITY</span><h2>Every contribution matters.</h2><p><strong><a href="https://github.com/v2elite">v2elite</a></strong> — splash screen artwork, credited by the upstream fork.</p><p><strong>ZZone and the Zod Engine community</strong> — feedback, maps, testing, and support acknowledged by the original Zod Engine project.</p><p>Thanks to the maintainers and contributors of the libraries and tools used here, including SDL, SDL_image, SDL_mixer, SDL_ttf, FluidSynth, PHP, MariaDB, and Go. The website uses the Rajdhani font under the SIL Open Font License; the game also uses Orbitron.</p><p>We also thank everyone who reports bugs, tests builds, contributes maps, and keeps these projects playable.</p></article><article id="licenses"><span class="eyebrow">04 / LICENSES &amp; SOURCES</span><h2>Credit stays with the creators.</h2><p>The Zod Engine source and this fork are distributed under GPLv3. Original copyright notices and third-party licenses remain applicable. That source-code license does not by itself relicense the original Z artwork, music, videos, characters, trademarks, or other game assets; those remain subject to their respective owners’ rights.</p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/fenio/zod">Upstream SDL3 fork and its acknowledgments</a></li><li><a href="https://zod.sourceforge.net/">Original Zod Engine project and community acknowledgments</a></li><li><a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/zod/">Zod Engine source and releases</a></li><li><a href="https://www.mobygames.com/game/346/z/">Original Z release information and credits</a></li><li><a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html">GNU General Public License version 3</a></li><li><a href="/assets/FONT-LICENSE.txt">Website font license</a></li></ul></article></div></div></section><?php
