)?></a></strong><span class="cell-sub"><?=e($match['server_id'])?></span></td><td><?=e($match['winners']?:'No human winner')?></td><td class="mono"><?=e(duration($match['duration']))?></td><td class="small dim"><?=e(stamp($match['finished_at']))?></td></tr><?php endforeach?></tbody></table></div><?php endif?></div></section><?php
    } elseif ($active==='account') {
        ?><section class="shell section page-section"><?php title_block('ZOD CLOUD / YOUR ACCOUNT',$me?'Welcome back, '.$me['username'].'.':'Your identity on the battlefield.',$me?'Your public match record follows your account. Private games remain separate.':'One Zod account for public servers, match history, and your place on the board.');?><?php if(isset($_GET['message'])&&is_string($_GET['message'])):?><p class="notice success" role="status"><?=e(substr($_GET['message'],0,180))?></p><?php endif?><?php if(isset($_GET['error'])&&is_string($_GET['error'])):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e(substr($_GET['error'],0,180))?></p><?php endif?><?php if(!$me):?><div class="account-grid"><section class="panel panel-pad"><span class="eyebrow">RETURNING COMMANDER</span><h2>Sign in.</h2><form class="account-form" action="/account/login" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e($token)?>"><input type="hidden" name="server_return_to" value="<?=e(is_string($_GET['server_connect']??null)?$_GET['server_connect']:'')?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="<?=e(is_string($_GET['connect']??null)?$_GET['connect']:'')?>"><label for="login-name">Username</label><input id="login-name" name="username" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="24"><label for="login-pass">Password</label><input id="login-pass" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"><button class="button button-primary">Sign in</button></form></section><section class="panel panel-pad"><span class="eyebrow">NEW TO ZOD CLOUD?</span><h2>Make your name.</h2><p class="dim">Accounts are free. You only need one for public servers.</p><form class="account-form" action="/account/register" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e($token)?>"><input type="hidden" name="server_return_to" value="<?=e(is_string($_GET['server_connect']??null)?$_GET['server_connect']:'')?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="<?=e(is_string($_GET['connect']??null)?$_GET['connect']:'')?>"><label for="register-name">Choose a username</label><input id="register-name" name="username" autocomplete="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="24" pattern="[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]{2,23}" aria-describedby="name-help"><small id="name-help">3–24 letters, numbers or underscores. Start with a letter.</small><label for="register-pass">Choose a password</label><input id="register-pass" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="12" maxlength="128" aria-describedby="password-help"><small id="password-help">At least 12 characters. Use a unique password and keep it safe.</small><button class="button button-primary">Create account</button></form></section></div><p class="section-note">Zod accounts are independent of other projects. Generate one-use recovery codes after signing in. Recovery does not require email.</p><?php else:$profile=$service->profile($me['username']);?><div class="stat-grid"><?php foreach([['PUBLIC MATCHES',$profile['stats']['matches']],['VICTORIES',$profile['stats']['wins']],['UNITS DESTROYED',$profile['stats']['kills']],['ZONES CAPTURED',$profile['stats']['captures']]] as [$label,$value]):?><div class="stat-card"><span class="micro"><?=$label?></span><strong><?=number($value)?></strong></div><?php endforeach?></div><div class="info-grid"><section class="panel panel-pad"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT ORDER</span><h2>Find a server. Make it count.</h2><p>Get a single-use ticket from the public directory. The website never sends your password to a game server.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button button-primary" href="/servers">Find a server</a><a class="text-link" href="/players/<?=rawurlencode($me['username'])?>">Your battle history</a></div><form action="/account/logout" method="post" class="logout-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e($token)?>"><button class="text-button">Sign out of this website</button></form></section><section class="panel panel-pad"><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT SECURITY</span><h2>Change password.</h2><form class="account-form" action="/account/password" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e($token)?>"><label for="current-pass">Current password</label><input id="current-pass" type="password" name="current_password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"><label for="new-pass">New password</label><input id="new-pass" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="12" maxlength="128"><button class="button">Update password</button><small>Other website sessions will be signed out. Existing game connections are unaffected.</small></form></section></div><?php endif?></section><?php
        account_tools($service,$token);
    } elseif ($active==='connect') {native_connect_page($service,$token);
    } elseif ($active==='community') {community_page($service,$token);
    } elseif ($active==='creations') {creations_page($service,$token);
    } elseif ($active==='profile') {
        $p=$profile;$stats=$p['stats'];?><section class="shell section page-section"><?php title_block('COMMANDER RECORD / PUBLIC PROFILE',$p['account']['username'],'On the board since '.gmdate('F Y',strtotime($p['account']['created_at'].' UTC')).'.');?><div class="stat-grid"><?php foreach([['MATCHES',$stats['matches']],['WINS',$stats['wins']],['UNITS DESTROYED',$stats['kills']],['ZONES CAPTURED',$stats['captures']]] as [$label,$value]):?><div class="stat-card"><span class="micro"><?=$label?></span><strong><?=number($value)?></strong></div><?php endforeach?></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Battle history.</h2><a href="/leaderboard" class="text-link">Back to leaderboard</a></div><div class="panel"><?php if(!$p['recent']):empty_state('A clean slate.','This commander has not completed a public match yet.','/servers','Find a server');else:?><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Battlefield</th><th>Result</th><th>Destroyed / lost</th><th>Zones</th><th>Duration</th><th>Date</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($p['recent'] as $r):?><tr><td><strong><a href="/match-history?id=<?=e($r['id'])?>"><?=e(map_title($r['map_name']))?></a></strong><span class="cell-sub"><?=e($r['server_id'])?></span></td><td><span class="badge <?=$r['won']?'online':'muted'?>"><?=$r['won']?'Victory':'Defeat'?></span></td><td class="mono"><?=number($r['kills'])?> / <?=number($r['lost'])?></td><td class="mono"><?=number($r['captures'])?></td><td class="mono"><?=e(duration($r['duration']))?></td><td class="small dim"><?=e(stamp($r['finished_at']))?></td></tr><?php endforeach?></tbody></table></div><?php endif?></div></section><?php
    } elseif ($active==='downloads') {
        $downloads=[];$file=env_value('ZOD_DOWNLOADS_FILE');if($file!==''){$downloads=json_decode(file_get_contents($file),true,32,JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR);if(!is_array($downloads))$downloads=[];}
        ?><section class="shell section page-section"><?php title_block('DEPLOY / DOWNLOADS','Pick your platform.','Modern builds for a classic battlefield. Release downloads appear here when the site operator publishes them.');?><div class="download-grid"><?php foreach([['windows','Windows','Portable game build','ZIP archive'],['macos','macOS','Apple Silicon app','Application bundle'],['linux','Linux','Headless dedicated hosting','Server archive']] as [$key,$name,$description,$format]):$entry=$downloads[$key]??null;$url=is_array($entry)?($entry['url']??''):'';$valid=is_string($url)&&(preg_match('~\Ahttps://[^\s]+\z~',$url)||preg_match('~\A/downloads/[A-Za-z0-9._/-]+\z~',$url));?><article class="panel panel-pad download-card"><span class="feature-number"><?=e($format)?></span><h2><?=e($name)?></h2><p><?=e($description)?></p><?php if($valid):?><span class="badge online"><i></i><?=e($entry['version']??'Published release')?></span><a class="button button-primary" href="<?=e($url)?>">Download</a><?php else:?><span class="badge muted">Release not published</span><a class="button" href="/guide#build">Build from source</a><?php endif?></article><?php endforeach?></div><div class="callout"><div><span class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE / GPLv3</span><h2>Built in the open.</h2><p>Get the source, build locally, or help make the next battle better.</p></div><a href="https://github.com/retrocs-org/enhanced-zod" class="button" rel="noreferrer">Browse the source</a></div></section><?php
    } else {
        ?><section class="shell section page-section"><?php title_block('SUPPLY LINES / FIELD GUIDE','From download to deployment.','A short guide to playing, joining, and hosting zod-enhanced.');?><div class="guide-layout"><aside><a href="#build">01 / Build the game</a><a href="#join">02 / Join a public server</a><a href="#hosting">03 / Host a battlefield</a><a href="#records">04 / Your records</a></aside><div class="guide-content"><article id="build"><span class="eyebrow">01 / GET THE GAME</span><h2>Build for your machine.</h2><p>Get the repository and follow its build instructions. macOS has a self-contained app builder; Windows has a portable package workflow; Linux supports headless dedicated hosting.</p><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/retrocs-org/enhanced-zod.git
cd zodee
# macOS, with Homebrew and Xcode tools:
./packaging/macos/build-app.sh
open build-app/zod-enhanced.app</code></pre><p><a href="https://github.com/retrocs-org/enhanced-zod#build--run" class="text-link">Full source build instructions</a></p></article><article id="join"><span class="eyebrow">02 / PUBLIC MULTIPLAYER</span><h2>Keep your identity. Join a battle.</h2><ol><li>Create a zod-enhanced account and sign in here.</li><li>Choose a server from the <a href="/servers">public directory</a>.</li><li>In the game, choose Multiplayer → Online games and select the server.</li><li>Approve the browser request; the game connects automatically. Manual ticket commands remain available in the directory.</li></ol><p>Tickets work once and only for the chosen server. Full or active matches may admit you as a spectator. Passwords stay with this website.</p></article><article id="hosting"><span class="eyebrow">03 / DEDICATED SERVERS</span><h2>Private by default. Public by choice.</h2><p>Private servers do not announce here and allow guests. Public hosts sign in through a browser to a cloud account. That account owns the server and manages its administrators under <a href="/my-servers">My servers</a>. All players and spectators also authenticate.</p><pre><code># Extract the Linux headless server archive:
./start-server --mode private

# Sign in once as the public server owner:
./start-server --mode public \
  --hub https://zodee.retrocs.org/index.php \
  --id YOUR-SERVER-ID --login</code></pre><p>Open the game TCP port (2137 by default). A private server credential is saved for restarts; omit --login next time. Owners can add or remove existing cloud accounts as server administrators. Public listings expire automatically when a server stops announcing. The repository includes Docker and systemd deployment files.</p></article><article id="records"><span class="eyebrow">04 / STATISTICS</span><h2>Results from the simulation.</h2><p>Account-owned public servers submit results for the authenticated players assigned when a round starts. Repeated uploads are deduplicated. Private battles are never uploaded. Bot matches count, and these statistics are unranked.</p><p>Website sign-in and join tickets are available now. Use account privacy settings, session controls and offline recovery codes to protect your account. Game traffic is not encrypted. Use a unique password and a trusted connection.</p></article></div></div></section><?php
    }
    join_dialog();echo '</main>';page_footer();
}
function render_error(int $status,string $message): void {page_header('error');?><section class="shell section page-section"><span class="eyebrow">TRANSMISSION / <?=e($status)?></span><h1><?=$status===404?'Off the map.':'Connection interrupted.'?></h1><p class="page-description"><?=e($message)?></p><a href="/" class="button button-primary">Back to overview</a></section></main><?php page_footer();}
